          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi Nebukadineza niyeekhupa hasi mafumama namwinamila Danieli, nalaka mbu bamuleerele isadaka nibamutuumilia amalesi keshing'aari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namusunjila Danieli ari Toto mwene, Nyasaye weenywe niye Nyasaye wabanyasaye, nOmwami wabaruchi, nomubisuli wakamabiswi; okhuba onyalile okhubisula libiso lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namukhulunduyia Danieli, namuheelesia ebihaanwa ebinji ebikhongo, namwemekha khulukongo lwosi lwaBabeli, namukhola omukhulundu khubachesi bosi baBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danieli nasaba omuruchi, naye naraho Shadaraka, Meshaki, nende Abedinego khumakhuwa kolukongo lwaBabeli; ne Danieli yatong'a mwitookho liomuruchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
